# Design

Dark glass: near-black background with a slow blurred warm gradient, frosted panels, 16px radius, high-contrast text.

- Accent amber for user actions.
- Violet for agent elements.
- Monospace for the agent trace.
- No text on busy images.
- Accessible contrast.
- Smooth but subtle motion.
